xscreensaver-matrixcode for Debian and Ubuntu
=============================================

This package installs one standalone XScreenSaver hack and its settings
metadata.  The default operator1999 profile intentionally frames the code as a
4:3 CRT image; black side areas on a widescreen display are therefore expected.

Restart xscreensaver-settings after installation.  The renderer requires X11
and GLX and is not a Wayland-native screen saver.
